  - Explain interactions with other handshake messages (by hannestschofenig)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls-key-update/issues/46=20
  - Move State Machines to the Appendix (by hannestschofenig)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls-key-update/issues/45=20

